WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:06.137
Welcome to Computer Class. Today you will learn: Write and Send an Email.

2
00:00:06.437 --> 00:00:10.610
Write a clear email and send it. Follow each step on your own computer.

3
00:00:11.617 --> 00:00:14.350
Step one. Click Compose or New email.

4
00:00:15.350 --> 00:00:21.639
Step two. Type the address in the To box. Then write a short subject that says what the email is about.

5
00:00:22.650 --> 00:00:29.577
Step three. Write your message. Start with a greeting, say what you need, say thank you, and write your name.

6
00:00:30.583 --> 00:00:36.199
Step four. To send a file, click Attach and choose it. Check the address, then click Send.

7
00:00:37.183 --> 00:00:41.206
Now it is your turn. Try these tasks on your own computer.

8
00:00:41.506 --> 00:00:43.401
Send an email to yourself.

9
00:00:43.701 --> 00:00:45.665
Attach a photo to your email.

10
00:00:45.965 --> 00:00:49.021
Reply to an email and use Dear and Best regards.

11
00:00:49.321 --> 00:00:50.485
Well done!

